# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PATIENT DATA — MIMIC-III / eICU are PhysioNet *credentialed* data.
# Nothing under these paths may ever reach a remote. Regenerate from
# PhysioNet via forpublication/preprocessing/ instead.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
forpublication/db/mimic_data/
forpublication/db/e-icu-data/
physionet.org/
*.parquet

# ── Trained weights + anything derived from patient data ──────────────
# best_model.pt files are fine-tuned on clinical notes (derived data), and
# test_predictions.csv / val_predictions.csv carry per-admission rows keyed
# by hadm_id / patientunitstayid. Keep all of it off the remote.
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
test_predictions.csv
val_predictions.csv

# ── Environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Editor / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# ── Local agent state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
